# `# description` must be plain text (module 4)

For lesson files in module **4-monitoring-and-observability**, the `# description` block is LMS catalog copy and must stay plain text.

## Required

- Write normal sentences as plain text (human-readable prose).
- Keep meaning aligned between `vi.md` and `en.md`.

## Do not use markdown styling in `# description`

- No bold/italic markers (`**...**`, `*...*`).
- No inline code/backticks.
- No markdown links (`[text](url)`).
- No bullet/numbered list formatting.

## Notes

- Technical terms are allowed as plain words (NestJS, OpenTelemetry, Jaeger, Prometheus, etc.).
- Put detailed technical structure in `# body`, not in `# description`.
